OL,3,AMajor Chinese brands drop Mbappe as
OL,4,Abacklash grows over Mao joke
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral Chinese brands have dropped
OL,7,FFrench footballer Kylian Mbappe as
OL,8,Fbacklash grew online over alleged
OL,9,Fcomments by him referring to the late
OL,10,FChinese leader Mao Zedong.
OL,12,FMbappe reportedly told French talk show
OL,13,FThe Bridge a meme "that makes me laugh
OL,14,Fthe most...the one where there's a
OL,15,Fvideo of a guy, I think it's a Chinese
OL,16,Fdictator". As he speaks, a meme appears
OL,17,Fwith his face superimposed on an image
OL,18,Fresembling Mao.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
