OL,3,AMajor Chinese brands drop Mbappe as
OL,4,Abacklash grows over Mao joke
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I use it with my friends all the
OL,7,Ftime," the Real Madrid forward adds, in
OL,8,Funverified clips that have been
OL,9,Fcirculating online.
OL,11,FMbappe does not identify Mao by name
OL,12,Fand the original video is no longer on
OL,13,Fthe show's YouTube channel, but
OL,14,Fscreengrabs have spread on Chinese
OL,15,Fsocial media.
